title: 'WAH: fix recovery benchmarks'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Recovery benchmarks for finish_attempt / cancel_attempt advance frame_system's block number, which does not move RelaychainDataProvider, causing NotYetInheritable / NotYetCancelable.
    Use frame_system under the benchmarking feature so the time-delay guards can be satisfied.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
